-90" srcset="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-13-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-13-300x200.jpg 300w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-13-768x512.jpg 768w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-13-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-13.jpg 1620w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><figcaption class="blocks-gallery-item__caption">SiO<sub>2</sub>&nbsp;– Var Ametista</figcaption></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><a href="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12.jpg" data-rel="lightbox-gallery-REj50ZZd" data-rl_title="Quartzo" data-rl_caption="Quartzo" title="Quartzo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12-1024x683.jpg" alt="" data-id="89" data-full-url="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12.jpg" data-link="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/quartzo-ametista-2/" class="wp-image-89" srcset="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12-300x200.jpg 300w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12-768x512.jpg 768w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-12.jpg 1620w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a><figcaption class="blocks-gallery-item__caption">SiO<sub>2</sub> &#8211; Var Ametista</figcaption></figure></li><li class="blocks-gallery-item"><figure><a href="https://didatico.igc.usp.br/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/quartzo-11.jpg" data-rel="lightbox-gallery-REj50ZZd" data-rl_title="Quartzo" data-rl_caption="Quartzo" title="Quartzo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="